sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Platform Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as AIGateway Controller<br/>ai-gateway-system
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap / ENV<br/>(ODH_MODULE_OPERATOR_*)
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer<br/>/manifests/
    participant GatewayAPI as Gateway API<br/>(HTTPRoutes, Gateways)
    participant Kuadrant as Kuadrant<br/>(AuthPolicies, RateLimitPolicies)
    participant Istio as Istio<br/>(DestinationRules, EnvoyFilters)
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager<br/>(Certificates)
    participant BatchGW as llm-d Batch Gateway<br/>(LLMBatchGateway)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>(ServiceMonitors)

    Note over Admin,K8sAPI: 1. CR Creation / Update
    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AIGateway CR<br/>(cluster-scoped)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch notification<br/>(AIGateway event)

    Note over Controller,ConfigMap: 2. Initialization
    Controller->>ConfigMap: Load configuration<br/>(mounted files + ENV vars)
    ConfigMap-->>Controller: Config values

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Read DSCInitialization CR<br/>(platform state)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Platform init data

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Read InferenceService CRs<br/>(model serving state)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Model serving data

    Note over Controller,Kustomize: 3. Reconciliation Action Chain
    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
        Controller->>Controller: initialize
        Controller->>Controller: ensureInfraSecretMigrationRBAC
        Controller->>Controller: upgradeIfNeeded
        Controller->>Controller: releases
        Controller->>Kustomize: Render manifests
        Kustomize-->>Controller: Rendered resources
        Controller->>Controller: annotateResource
        Controller->>Controller: migrateSelector
    end

    Note over Controller,Prometheus: 4. Resource Deployment
    par Deploy Gateway API Resources
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update HTTPRoutes
        K8sAPI-->>GatewayAPI: HTTPRoute applied
    and Deploy Kuadrant Policies
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update AuthPolicies,<br/>TokenRateLimitPolicies
        K8sAPI-->>Kuadrant: Policies applied
    and Deploy Istio Resources
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update DestinationRules,<br/>EnvoyFilters, ServiceEntries
        K8sAPI-->>Istio: Networking configured
    and Deploy TLS Certificates
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Certificates
        K8sAPI-->>CertMgr: Certificate request
    and Deploy Batch Gateway (if Managed)
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update LLMBatchGateway
        K8sAPI-->>BatchGW: Batch gateway reconciled
    and Deploy Observability
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitors,<br/>OTel Collectors, Perses Dashboards
        K8sAPI-->>Prometheus: Monitoring configured
    end

    Note over Controller,K8sAPI: 5. Status & Cleanup
    Controller->>Controller: reportSubModuleStatus
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update AIGateway status
    Controller->>Controller: Garbage collect orphaned resources

    Note over Controller: 6. Metrics Exposure
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Expose metrics<br/>:8443/metrics (ClusterIP)
